==Battleground==
*1 [[Aura (Enemy)|Aura]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Yoichi (Enemy)|Yoichis]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Yoichi (Enemy)|Yoichi]] spawns after 34.67 seconds<sup>1,040f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Serum (Enemy)|Serums]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Serum (Enemy)|Serum]] spawns after 47.33 seconds<sup>1,420f</sup>.
*1 [[Healer (Enemy)|Healer]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Wyvern (Enemy)|Wyvern]] spawns as the boss after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to have at least 4 meatshields, preferably [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] and [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] included. Unless you have a unit that outranges Wyvern and can deal good damage to it, you can just rely on [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] to take it out. This is even more important on 4 crown, where you are likely lacking in good meatshields.

